```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Library Management System</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;background:#f2f2f2;text-align:center}
nav{background:#222;padding:15px}
nav a{color:white;margin:10px;text-decoration:none}
div{background:white;margin:20px;padding:20px}
input,select,button{padding:8px;margin:5px}
table{margin:auto;border-collapse:collapse}
th,td{border:1px solid black;padding:8px}
th{background:#333;color:white}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>📚 Library Management System</h1>

<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#books">Books</a>
<a href="#login">Login</a>
<a href="#admin">Admin</a>
<a href="#user">User</a>
</nav>

<div id="books">
<h2>Book Catalog</h2>
<input type="text" placeholder="Search Book">
<button>Search</button>

<table>
<tr><th>Book</th><th>Author</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Java</td><td>James</td><td>Available</td></tr>
<tr><td>Python</td><td>Mark</td><td>Issued</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div id="login">
<h2>Login</h2>
<input type="email" placeholder="Email">
<input type="password" placeholder="Password">
<button>Login</button>
</div>

<div id="admin">
<h2>Librarian Admin</h2>
<button>Add Book</button>
<button>Update Book</button>
<button>Delete Book</button>
<button>Issue Book</button>
<button>Return Book</button>
<button>Make Fine</button>
</div>

<div id="user">
<h2>User Account</h2>
<p>Borrow History: Java - Issued</p>
<p>Issue Date: 01-10-2026</p>
<p>Expected Date: 15-10-2026</p>
<p>Fine: ₹50</p>
<button>My Profile</button>
</div>

<div>
<h2>Study Material</h2>
<select>
<option>1st Year</option>
<option>2nd Year</option>
<option>3rd Year</option>
<option>4th Year</option>
</select>

<select>
<option>Semester 1</option>
<option>Semester 2</option>
</select>

<button>Search</button>
<button>Download</button>
</div>

<div>
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<input type="text" placeholder="Name">
<input type="email" placeholder="Email">
<button>Send</button>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
